      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-26T01:19:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Étienne Ruffieux,\n\n\nMoto added config_safe_media_volume_bt_index in frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml since AudioService need to use the resouce as well, also we added try catch{} in Blutooth side, in other words, if Bluetooth can\u0027t find the resouce, then the logic of \"back to safe volume\" will not be invoked.\n\nAbout safe volume background, I have added comments in b/405822168.",
      "parentUuid": "51d46df6_235e92cb",
      "revId": "4e898a89a11d87b601862f7dcff7d9af16ea8cd3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
